[32m+[m[32m# Agent protections[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRepository hooks run the supplied deterministic ingress guard and action supervisor[m
[32m+[m[32mfor Claude Code, Codex, and GitHub Copilot. Cursor receives an instruction rule;[m
[32m+[m[32mthis is not a claim that Cursor has command-hook enforcement.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`policy.json` defines protected paths, quarantined content, secret paths, and[m
[32m+[m[32mnetwork/MCP allowlists. Network and MCP access start denied. Preserve task-specific[m
[32m+[m[32mscope in the supervisor section. A reviewed `policy.local.json` can override local[m
[32m+[m[32mpolicy; it must not be committed.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRun `node --test .guard/tests/guard.ts` with Node 24 and Python 3.11 or later.[m
[32m+[m[32mThe tests use temporary repositories and state directories, not your session logs.[m
[32m+[m[32mCI validates syntax and behavior, rejects hidden Unicode in changed text and runs Gitleaks. Existing[m
[32m+[m[32mproject CI remains responsible for application tests; the local completion hook[m
[32m+[m[32mruns the repository's `.guard/checks/on-stop`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAfter merging, review and trust the project and Codex hooks before using them.[m
[32m+[m[32mHooks are guardrails, not an OS security boundary. No machine-level locks, daemon,[m
[32m+[m[32mfirewall, GitHub ruleset, required check, or required review is installed by these[m
[32m+[m[32mfiles. CODEOWNERS only requests reviews unless repository settings require them.[m
[32m+[m[32mPost-tool scanning cannot undo an operation. Host sandboxes and server-side[m
[32m+[m[32mprotection remain separate requirements.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe bundled supervisor was chosen over the separate older download because it[m
[32m+[m[32msupports cross-agent payloads and project-root resolution. This rollout changes[m
[32m+[m[32mits malformed-input/policy and internal-error handling to deny instead of allow.[m
[32m+[m[32mThe regex policy cannot prove that arbitrary indirect shell execution is safe.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDocumentation sources checked during preparation:[m
[32m+[m[32m- https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/hooks[m
[32m+[m[32m- https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/config-file/config-reference[m
[32m+[m[32m- https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/hooks-reference[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe bundled Codex config now uses the documented top-level `web_search = "disabled"`.[m
[32m+[m[32mThe provided Python implementation is preserved; the new regression tests use TypeScript.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCI blocks invisible/bidirectional Unicode markers. Broad natural-language injection[m
[32m+[m[32mpatterns run in the ingress hooks; they are not blanket CI failures because[m
[32m+[m[32mlegitimate security policies, instructions and specifications match them.[m
[32m+[m[32mLocal check adapters invoke Bash explicitly and do not rely on executable bits.[m
