[32m+[m[32mchains (ported from agent-pi, with its false-positive causes fixed), maintains a[m
[32m+[m[32mdecaying cumulative risk, and returns one of three verdicts:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    allow  -> exit 0[m
[32m+[m[32m    deny   -> exit 2, reason shown to the worker, logged[m
[32m+[m[32m    halt   -> exit 2 AND a HALT marker is written; every later call in this session is[m
[32m+[m[32m              denied until a human removes the marker.[m
[32m+[m
